+---
+id: task-003-give-back-single-use-coupon-on-cancel-check-free-shipping-at-50-euros
+type: task
+title: "Give back single-use coupon on cancel; check free shipping at 50 euros"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+## Request
+1. Single-use welcome coupon was refused after cancelling the order that used it. Cause: `OrderService.cancel`
+   gave the coupon back under the customer name instead of the order id, so it was never released. Fixed in
+   `src/orders.ts`; test added.
+2. €4.90 shipping charged on goods of exactly €50.00. The threshold (`>= 5000`) was already fixed in an earlier
+   request; goods of exactly €50.00 now ship free (tests added, also after a coupon). If goods were above
+   €50.00 gross but below it after discounts, the README rule (free from €50.00 after every discount) applies.
diff --git a/src/orders.ts b/src/orders.ts
index 0c0b1ae889c9df13dffa9de7ed1924a4e8b09afd..e4c175527cc500b240776198678b04a3145894ea 100644
--- a/src/orders.ts
+++ b/src/orders.ts
@@ -153,7 +153,7 @@ export class OrderService {
       throw new OrderStateError(`order ${id} can no longer be cancelled`);
     }
     for (const line of order.lines) this.#inventory.release(line.sku, line.quantity, id);
-    if (order.coupon !== undefined) this.#coupons.giveBack(order.coupon, order.customer);
+    if (order.coupon !== undefined) this.#coupons.giveBack(order.coupon, id);
     const cancelled: Order = { ...order, status: 'cancelled', cancelledOn: date };
     this.#orders.set(id, cancelled);
     return cancelled;
diff --git a/test/orders.test.ts b/test/orders.test.ts
index d07f06bd09b3489b674e3119a14ea7d2ced148a7..8c70d32035e1a1c82cc26acc213669c2bcf44234 100644
